        <h2 style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 700; color: oklch(0.21 0.034 264.665); line-height: 1.33333; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;' data-pasted="true"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-weight: 800; color: inherit;">City Treasurer Appointive Question</strong></h2><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px 0px 1.25em; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>At the November 3, 2026 General Municipal Election, Lake Elsinore voters will be asked to vote on Measure T, which concerns the office of City Treasurer.</p><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>The ballot question is:</p><blockquote style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.6em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.21 0.034 264.665); border-inline-start-width: 0.25rem; border-inline-start-color: oklch(0.928 0.006 264.531); quotes: "“" "”" "‘" "’"; padding-inline-start: 1em; font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><p style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5);"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-weight: 600; color: inherit;">&ldquo;Shall the office of City Treasurer be appointive?&rdquo;</strong>&nbsp;</p></blockquote><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>The City Council approved placing this question before voters at its May 12, 2026 meeting. The election will be consolidated with the statewide general election and conducted in coordination with the Riverside County Registrar of Voters. &nbsp;</p><hr style="box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: oklch(0.928 0.006 264.531); border-image: none; margin: 3em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); height: 0px; color: inherit; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><h2 style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 700; color: oklch(0.21 0.034 264.665); line-height: 1.33333; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-weight: 800; color: inherit;">About the City Treasurer Position</strong></h2><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px 0px 1.25em; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>The City Treasurer is currently an elected office. Under the Lake Elsinore Municipal Code, the City Treasurer is elected from the City at large at a general municipal election and serves a four-year term until a successor is elected and qualified. &nbsp;</p><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>The City Treasurer serves as the custodian of public funds belonging to, or under the control of, the City or any City office, department, or agency. The Treasurer performs duties prescribed by the City Council consistent with the Municipal Code and applicable law.&nbsp;</p><hr style="box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: oklch(0.928 0.006 264.531); border-image: none; margin: 3em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); height: 0px; color: inherit; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><h2 style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px 0px 1em; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 700; color: oklch(0.21 0.034 264.665); line-height: 1.33333; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); font-weight: 800; color: inherit;">What Measure T Would Do</strong></h2><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 0px 0px 1.25em; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>If approved by a majority of voters voting on the measure, Measure T would change the City Treasurer position from an elected office to an appointed office. &nbsp;</p><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>The proposed ordinance provides that the City Treasurer would be appointed by the City Manager. The City Manager may appoint the Director of Finance, another qualified professional with government finance experience, or may self-appoint, consistent with applicable law.&nbsp;</p><p style='box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid rgb(226, 232, 240); margin: 1.25em 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.454448 -0.114161 0.0868082 / 0.5); color: oklch(0.278 0.033 256.848); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>The change would take effect at the conclusion of the current elected Treasurer&rsquo;s term or upon an earlier vacancy. &nbsp;</p><hr style="box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: oklch(0.928 0.006 264.531); border-image: none; margin: 3em 0px; padding: 0px; outline